  Text:
    Image:
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 1230122396758091596, guid: 1b99c3582effb1441908dafa4049712d, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1852217462, guid: 5810db99b9acdd247a30bb00b1347f82, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 1230122396758091596, guid: 1b99c3582effb1441908dafa4049712d, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1852217462, guid: 5810db99b9acdd247a30bb00b1347f82, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1852217462, guid: 5810db99b9acdd247a30bb00b1347f82, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1852217462, guid: 5810db99b9acdd247a30bb00b1347f82, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    messages:
    - Here is my kid, what do you think is wrong with them?
    - '*pathetic coughing '
    - ' I don''t know exactly what''s wrong but to create a cure i think i would
      need some simple ingredients'
    - What do we need?
    - '*more pathetic coughing*'
    - To start we will need 1 bundle of Foxglove and 3 SnapDragon Seeds
    - I think you can get some Snapdragon at the store north of us
    - And i know a local growth of FoxGlove south of the village
    - Once i have acquired the ingredients i'll bring them back and cure your child
    - If you forget just come back here anyways and i'll remind you
  Text2:
    Image:
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: -1013286787617399315, guid: 9dc01c27d0f7e8b4fbf4376b6faaefa7, type: 3}
    messages:
    - Have you gotten the ingredients yet?
    - If you have forgotten we need 1 SnapDragon you can get from the store
    - and some Foxglove Seeds south of the village
  Inv:
    invName: Quest - Gather Ingredients
    InventoryType: 0
    Items: []
    LimitedInv: 1
    InvSize: 2
  Inventory:
    invName: 
    InventoryType: 0
    Items: []
    LimitedInv: 0
    InvSize: 0
  askingforhelp: 0
